  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You rewrite the ecological blueprint of a 1-mile-radius region. Choose three of the following permanent alterations: all beasts in the region become non-hostile to you; all plants grow in geometric patterns; the region becomes impenetrable to Druidic divination; animal calls cease; the ground becomes hyper-fertile (double food yield, double plant growth rate); or one damage type (your choice) deals half damage to all creatures in the region. These effects persist until countered by a Wish or 9th-level Dispel.</p>",
